  "finding": "With immediate authored results, worker execution totals 2.547109 ms for 2119 requests; publication-to-receipt totals 53077.480579 ms. Worker repaint requests precede drain by median 25.411364 ms in 957 retained samples. The bounded finding is waiting after publication/wakeup request and before UI receipt; current source receives only inside the UI frame. Event-loop notification arrival, redraw scheduling, presentation and driver contributions are not separately instrumented, so the root cause inside that interval is not established.",
